# SUPERSEDED by fnox.toml (in this directory) — kept as a breadcrumb only.
#
# Secrets are now declared as op:// pointers in fnox.toml and resolved from
# 1Password via fnox. This file is NO LONGER read by .envrc; editing it has no
# effect.
#
# To change a secret: edit the 1Password item (Private vault), e.g.
#   op item edit cuda-dev 'OPENAI_API_KEY[password]=sk-NEW'
# then regenerate the gitignored, fnox-derived .env this repo loads:
#   fnox export -f env -o .env
